          "chapter_order": 46,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "当两个孙悟空都快用尽最后一点儿力量的时候，如来出现了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "如来向斗成一片的二人开口呼唤「孙悟空」，两人全跳了开来，同声反问「叫俺老孙作甚？」",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0057/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0057"
      },
      "revealed_at": 46,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000046.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000046",
          "chapter_order": 46,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "两人全跳了开来"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-5",
      "text": "如来对孙悟空说：「你若跳得出我掌心，便把天宫让你，若跳不出时，你便老实下界，再修几劫，莫来争吵。」",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0057/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0057"
      },
      "revealed_at": 46,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000046.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000046",
          "chapter_order": 46,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "你若跳得出我掌心，便把天宫让你"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-6",
      "text": "孙悟空反问如来「你在和谁说话？」",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 46,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000046.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000046",
          "chapter_order": 46,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "你在和谁说话？"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-7",
      "text": "那只没戴金箍的猴子拄棒狂笑，说「我现在不就已在你的掌心外么？谁要与你赌，老孙很忙，还有很多地方要拆，没空陪你耍子。」",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "没戴金箍的猴子"
      },
      "revealed_at": 46,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000046.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000046",
          "chapter_order": 46,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我现在不就已在你的掌心外么"
